  "details": "This bug annoys me the most. It seems avatars don't sort it by name (A to Z) in the wing menu anymore, even when I click on it (it does it in both quick menu and UI by the way).\nAdded Questions from users:\nNo, switching to another Favorite list/Recents doesn't fix the sorting for Names.\nThe Wing avatar in either menu doesn't sort by name when I click on it, but the one in the avatar menu works.\nHere's video of it. https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/449386885299830794/1031745079448182804/2022-10-17_18-44-29.mp4",
